    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u300aHeaven\u2019s Gambler\u300bis\u00a0top-down 3D action game immerses you in a cyberpunk world where limitless possibilities emerge from diverse gear combinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Combat experience\uff1a</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 The slot machine-style skill mechanic keeps battles dynamic. Crave adrenaline-pumping thrills? High-risk, high-reward skills can obliterate foes in seconds! Prefer tactical mastery? Craft the\u00a0slots\u00a0and dominate the battlefield!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684590/extras/bc39c8e09afac1db5915dbafb7c96ecc.poster.avif?t=1746561350\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684590/extras/bc39c8e09afac1db5915dbafb7c96ecc.webm?t=1746561350\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684590/extras/bc39c8e09afac1db5915dbafb7c96ecc.mp4?t=1746561350\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684590/extras/5935b195f88f1df7febb45278ae304a3.poster.avif?t=1746561350\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684590/extras/5935b195f88f1df7febb45278ae304a3.webm?t=1746561350\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684590/extras/5935b195f88f1df7febb45278ae304a3.mp4?t=1746561350\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Level\u00a0Design\uff1a</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 Heaven City offers extravagant entertainment and sky-high bounties. Gear up and dive into its neon-lit excesses to claim your rewards!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684590/extras/49b948e1a4c29cd9fa433c5dc155f577.poster.avif?t=1746561350\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684590/extras/49b948e1a4c29cd9fa433c5dc155f577.webm?t=1746561350\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684590/extras/49b948e1a4c29cd9fa433c5dc155f577.mp4?t=1746561350\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u300aHeaven\u2019s Gambler\u300bis\u00a0top-down 3D action game immerses you in a cyberpunk world where limitless possibilities emerge from diverse gear combinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Combat experience\uff1a</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 The slot machine-style skill mechanic keeps battles dynamic. Crave adrenaline-pumping thrills? High-risk, high-reward skills can obliterate foes in seconds! Prefer tactical mastery? Craft the\u00a0slots\u00a0and dominate the battlefield!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684590/extras/bc39c8e09afac1db5915dbafb7c96ecc.poster.avif?t=1746561350\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684590/extras/bc39c8e09afac1db5915dbafb7c96ecc.webm?t=1746561350\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684590/extras/bc39c8e09afac1db5915dbafb7c96ecc.mp4?t=1746561350\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684590/extras/5935b195f88f1df7febb45278ae304a3.poster.avif?t=1746561350\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684590/extras/5935b195f88f1df7febb45278ae304a3.webm?t=1746561350\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684590/extras/5935b195f88f1df7febb45278ae304a3.mp4?t=1746561350\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Level\u00a0Design\uff1a</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 Heaven City offers extravagant entertainment and sky-high bounties. Gear up and dive into its neon-lit excesses to claim your rewards!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684590/extras/49b948e1a4c29cd9fa433c5dc155f577.poster.avif?t=1746561350\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684590/extras/49b948e1a4c29cd9fa433c5dc155f577.webm?t=1746561350\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684590/extras/49b948e1a4c29cd9fa433c5dc155f577.mp4?t=1746561350\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
